rooms_desc ({"  As you look around a sense of peace washes over you like the morning  dew off a rose petal.  The serenity of this garden is added to by the  faint sound of water trickling by in tiny streams and occasionally  forming sparkling deep ponds.  The sounds of cascading water reaches  you from a tiny waterfall atop of which resides a small green dragon  basking in the sun.  A small path of gleaming white stones leads around  this garden as if to show you the sights, on occassion the path  crosses one of the tiny streams by way of a small arched bridge.  The  dragon shifts uneasily in his slumber and a single tear falls from  his eye adding to the flow from the waterfall.  A small central  glade is adorned with wicker chairs and a small wicker table,  perhaps for serving tea or entertaining guests.  You feel welcome here.There is a sign by the waterfall.","This room is a special room to thumper,here she can dream the dreams of magic and wonder.  There is a large bay window here thatoverlooks the ocean, and the smell of sea water turns yourthoughts to days gone by.  So stay a while and deep thoughtsand peace will be yours for a time","This is a patio with many small gardens withinin the center there is a fountain with a chruib and all around there is the smell of many different flowersplease walk around and enjoy this place","This is the master bathroom . There is a sunkin tub in the center of the roomThere are many fluffy towels lying aboutthe skylight seems to make the room glow","This is thumpers bedroom in the middle of the room is huge bedthere are pillows all around the room and a full wall of mirrors","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,})
